You already know scrolls of charging, so writing more costs about 1/8th 
of a wish each, which gives (average) 6.5 more zaps of polymorph.  This 
works out to each polypile zap costing about 2% of a wish.  The value 
gained from each zap is typically going to be much more than 2% of a 
wish...

Though I don't suggest polypiling specifically for ?RC, it's worth 
throwing a few excess scrolls on when polypiling other items, and 
hopefully some of them will turn into scrolls you want, if not ?C 
specifically.  The other items on your polypile, especially rings, 
could easily turn into ways to help you cross water.

I hope you at least looted all the valley chests first.




